      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of endless cycling, of putting in effort only to fall back to the same spot, is utterly draining. It's a very understandable conclusion to reach when you've been fighting so hard. If the goal of \"healing\" feels like an impossible, endless battle, maybe the focus could shift to finding ways to create a little more *relief* in the moment, rather than a permanent cure. You are not defined by the cycles you feel trapped in.",
      "source": "target",
